WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:06.035
Open Meals from Home. Choose your cooking style and date, then review ideas based on

00:06.035 --> 00:11.602
recorded pantry ingredients. Keep pantry amounts current so those ideas have useful

00:11.602 --> 00:12.139
context.

00:15.400 --> 00:20.878
Check an idea against what you actually have and your dietary needs. Built in ideas

00:20.878 --> 00:25.828
work without Apple Intelligence. These are meal ideas, not complete cooking

00:25.828 --> 00:27.808
instructions or safety advice.

00:30.400 --> 00:35.508
When planning a meal, review missing ingredients and add what you need to Shopping.

00:35.508 --> 00:40.616
Check existing shopping matches first. Buy the ingredients, then review whether the

00:40.616 --> 00:42.462
purchase should update Pantry.

00:45.400 --> 00:50.889
You can use the optional five p.m. planning reminder to think about tomorrow. It does

00:50.889 --> 00:55.732
not generate or save a meal automatically. You stay in control of the plan.
